<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/18th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Battle</p><h1 class="enc-title">Battle of Oudenarde</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1708</span> · Also known as Oudenarde · Part of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/war-of-the-spanish-succession">War of the Spanish Succession</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Battle of Oudenarde was fought on 11 July 1708 on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/scheldt">Scheldt</a> in the Spanish <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kingdom-of-the-netherlands">Netherlands</a>, where an allied army under the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/john-churchill-1st-duke-of-marlborough">Duke of Marlborough</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/prince-eugene-of-savoy">Prince Eugene of Savoy</a> defeated a French army under the Dukes of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/burgundy">Burgundy</a> and Vendôme. The victory let the allies recover the initiative in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/flanders">Flanders</a> and besiege the fortress of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lille">Lille</a>, which fell later that year.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/battle-of-oudenarde.jpg" alt="Battle of Oudenarde" width="320" height="254" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Copy_after_Jan_van_Huchtenburgh_(Haarlem_1647-Amsterdam_1733)_-_The_Battle_of_Oudenarde,_1708._-_RCIN_404900_-_Royal_Collection.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
